        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Naked Soldier, Naked Killer, Naked Weapon\n- Topics: Naked film series, Hong Kong action-thriller films\n- People: Tony Ching, Maggie Q, Anya Wu, Daniel Wu\n\nFacts:\n- Naked Killer was released in 1992.\n- Naked Weapon is a 2002 Hong Kong action-thriller film.\n- Naked Weapon was directed by Tony Ching.\n- Naked Weapon stars Maggie Q, Anya Wu, and Daniel Wu.\n- Naked Soldier is the third installment in the Naked film series.\n- The Naked film series includes Naked Killer, Naked Weapon, and Naked Soldier.",
